{"en": "1435566088", "title": "Liste de contrôle d'acceptation des échantillons", "adf": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "9b3e48e59e8f"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Fait partie de : ", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "Gestion du catalogue de tests : vue d'ensemble du processus", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1437270018"}}, {"type": "em"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "1179b1ef786c"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Guide pratique · Administrateurs de laboratoire (configuration) + personnel de saisie des demandes (utilisation)", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}, {"type": "extension", "attrs": {"layout": "default", "extensionType": "com.atlassian.confluence.macro.core", "extensionKey": "toc", "parameters": {"macroParams": {"style": {"value": "none"}}, "macroMetadata": {"macroId": {"value": "b9192470-22d7-41f6-aaf0-92e2e30e9673"}, "schemaVersion": {"value": "1"}, "title": "Table of Contents"}}, "localId": "dba1ba9b-09ef-42b6-aa22-04d446606907"}}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "d3d896d7217b"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "La liste de contrôle d'acceptation des échantillons ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Sample Acceptance Checklist", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") permet à un laboratoire de définir des "}, {"type": "text", "text": "critères d'acceptation", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (par ex. « Contenant du spécimen intact et correctement étiqueté ») que le personnel confirme à l'étape "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Revue Assurance Qualité", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "QA Review", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") lors de la saisie d'une demande d'analyse. La liste est "}, {"type": "text", "text": "configurable par domaine", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (clinique / environnemental / vectoriel), avec une liste commune à tout le laboratoire par défaut, et chaque domaine choisit son niveau d'application : "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Obligatoire", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Mandatory", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") fait de la saisie d'une réponse à chaque élément une "}, {"type": "text", "text": "condition préalable à l'acceptation de l'échantillon", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Facultatif", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Optional", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") enregistre les réponses sans bloquer, et "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Désactivé", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Off", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") masque la liste."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "473a608e3901"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Le fonctionnement comporte deux volets : les "}, {"type": "text", "text": "administrateurs configurent", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " la liste (Administration → Configuration de saisie de commande → Exemple de liste de contrôle pour l'acceptation des échantillons), et le personnel de saisie des demandes "}, {"type": "text", "text": "y répond à l'étape Revue Assurance Qualité", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " du processus d'ajout de demande propre au domaine (par ex. Ajouter une ordonnance clinique → Saisir la demande d’examen → Prélever un échantillon → Étiqueter et stocker → "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Revue Assurance Qualité", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ")."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "8f399906c2ef"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Remarque :", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " cette liste est distincte de l'action "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Rejeter l'échantillon", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Reject Sample", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") disponible sur un échantillon (qui enregistre un motif de rejet en vue d'un nouveau prélèvement). La liste de contrôle d'acceptation des échantillons est la liste configurable de la Revue Assurance Qualité décrite ici."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "6bca998c62eb"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Partie 1 : Configurer la liste de contrôle (administrateur)"}]}, {"type": "table", "attrs": {"layout": "default", "width": 760.0, "localId": "6fd32f0ed89a"}, "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "18aa1b994609"}, "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "003710a5a33b"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "a83d0fd638aa"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Objectif"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "170e83d01a7d"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "2f8c3dba1573"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Définir, par domaine, les critères d'acceptation que le personnel confirme et leur niveau d'application."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "60c1dcff6586"}, "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "4234f4023312"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "3e5d3c7826fd"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Résultat obtenu"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "408d75cc066a"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "7318072c1889"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Une liste de contrôle active (pour tout le laboratoire et/ou par domaine) et un niveau d'application pour chaque domaine."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "2ca530de93f9"}, "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "af9e39367fe2"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "d0b558145e6a"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Qui s'en charge"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "5c6dff2e4613"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "9fce438b3c43"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Administrateurs de laboratoire. L'accès dépend des droits de l'utilisateur et peut être configuré par votre administrateur."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "de4e51f157c0"}, "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "51a6b63b185e"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "2485be739e66"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Avant de commencer"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "18ebe319f7d4"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "b09fc100f550"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Les critères d'acceptation que votre laboratoire souhaite appliquer."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "9e07825f2cdd"}, "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "eeb9de8ae97f"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "cfb1d4ee43f7"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Où"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "13e823ca8cfb"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "1eceba41c0d8"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Menu principal → Administration → Configuration de saisie de commande → "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Exemple de liste de contrôle pour l'acceptation des échantillons", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Sample Acceptance Checklist", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ")."}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "94bfcbc53a30", "order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "029b7d3ccabe"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "6865aefb94fb"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ouvrez "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Exemple de liste de contrôle pour l'acceptation des échantillons", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ". Le sous-menu propose "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Tous les domaines", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "All domains", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", pour tout le laboratoire) ainsi que "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Clinique", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Clinical", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "), "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Environnemental", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Environmental", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") et "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Vecteur", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Vector", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ")."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 959, "alt": "SAC.png", "id": "9a89e155-8842-4b3e-8b43-16d9bfe4abde", "collection": "contentId-1435566088", "type": "file", "localId": "ded8c3f73b5e", "height": 341}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}, {"type": "caption", "attrs": {"localId": "18f8930967e9"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Liste de contrôle d'acceptation des échantillons", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "319c57f22193", "order": 2}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "da29d788fa5b"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "ef7918d19e20"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Dans "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Tous les domaines", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", ajoutez les critères qui s'appliquent partout : cliquez sur "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Ajouter un élément", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Add item", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "),"}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 958, "alt": "add item.png", "id": "90bc079c-bdd7-41f3-9c19-081f15f36f69", "collection": "contentId-1435566088", "type": "file", "localId": "77993254b515", "height": 329}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}, {"type": "caption", "attrs": {"localId": "95e8f71f3382"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ajouter un élément", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "2d2ee0239813", "order": 2}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "8f8b00058a75"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "ca9dbf294833"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": " Saisissez une "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Etiquette", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Label", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "), puis cliquez sur "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Enregistrer", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Save", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "). Chaque élément s'affiche avec "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Demande d'examen", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Order", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", ordre d'affichage modifiable avec les flèches haut/bas), "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Etiquette", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Actif", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Active", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") et "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Modifier", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Edit", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ")."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 959, "alt": "add a la.png", "id": "797d1d10-f085-4315-8451-6a7e00aac074", "collection": "contentId-1435566088", "type": "file", "localId": "4cc55ffc2bdd", "height": 351}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}, {"type": "caption", "attrs": {"localId": "74418145020c"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ajouter un libellé et enregistrer", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "note", "localId": "2fa91f38be6e"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "806cda056538"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "a. Pour adapter un domaine, ouvrez-le (par ex. "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Clinique", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "). Il affiche une liste déroulante "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Checklist enforcement", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (niveau d'application) : "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Obligatoire", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (réponse requise pour accepter l'échantillon), "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Facultatif", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (enregistrer sans bloquer) ou "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Désactivé", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (masquer), ainsi que les éléments propres au domaine et les "}, {"type": "text", "text": "éléments hérités de la liste commune au laboratoire", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (affichés comme « Active (inherited) »)."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "5a12586e1f14"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "b. Le niveau d'application se définit "}, {"type": "text", "text": "par domaine, et non par unité de laboratoire", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "e5f913db745e"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Liste déroulante du niveau d'application par domaine et éléments hérités de la liste commune au laboratoire (Clinique).", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 959, "alt": "enforcement.png", "id": "e9ccb5de-2216-4ba5-8fc0-49bdd8a9bdd5", "collection": "contentId-1435566088", "type": "file", "localId": "d0513f0beca6", "height": 615}, "marks": [{"type": "border", "attrs": {"size": 2, "color": "#758195"}}]}, {"type": "caption", "attrs": {"localId": "0f70ac32a559"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Liste des éléments communs au laboratoire avec Ajouter un élément.", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "513ca52735ea"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Partie 2 : Répondre à la liste de contrôle lors de la Revue Assurance Qualité (étape 4)"}]}, {"type": "table", "attrs": {"layout": "default", "width": 760.0, "localId": "cd525d87e2be"}, "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "467f4e830834"}, "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "25dd9cb78b2d"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "54daef1b3ef9"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Objectif"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "1af6d322b3b4"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "e6e7c81b8ad5"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Renseigner chaque critère d'acceptation d'un échantillon lors de la Revue Assurance Qualité et l'accepter, ou bien signaler une non-conformité / demander un nouveau prélèvement."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "508344600e62"}, "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "e25db6a77e1e"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "637547333e52"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Résultat obtenu"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "af849c8c9e17"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "9def63629228"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Chaque échantillon marqué "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Accepté", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Accepted", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") (ou ENC / nouveau prélèvement), avec les réponses à la liste de contrôle enregistrées."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "42fe37b2cf0d"}, "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "c06577744b84"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "20d61573c6f5"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Qui s'en charge"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "69c9b3b5bf06"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "ea274a6c4269"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Personnel de saisie des demandes / personnel d'accueil. L'accès dépend des droits de l'utilisateur."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "e49775b4a72b"}, "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "f97b4a080866"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "90723f1f894d"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Avant de commencer"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "962d559a5e34"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "38e20308c10a"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Une liste de contrôle configurée (partie 1) et une demande d'analyse en cours."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "986f13191d1b"}, "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "af02782437e6"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "bb73b1ac0a13"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Où"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "297a0c07e956"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "f9f9ce67db0d"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ordonnance → Ajouter une ordonnance → "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Ajouter une ordonnance clinique", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Add Clinical Order", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") → Saisir la demande d’examen → Prélever un échantillon → Étiqueter et stocker → "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Revue Assurance Qualité", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "."}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"localId": "5d89ca61eb85", "order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "41c27d76b723"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "5ef128b6795f"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Faites progresser la demande d'analyse à travers les étapes "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Saisir la demande d’examen → Prélever un échantillon → Étiqueter et stocker → Revue Assurance Qualité", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (ou accédez directement à "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Revue Assurance Qualité", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " depuis le menu pour une demande en cours)."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "9972176ca094"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "13a44d839745"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Dans "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Revue Assurance Qualité", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", le panneau "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Validation de l'admission", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Intake Acceptance", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") liste chaque échantillon (n° de laboratoire, type d'échantillon, transport, éligibilité). Sélectionnez un échantillon pour afficher sa liste de contrôle ; la liste active correspond au domaine de la demande (par ex. « Active list: Clinical »)."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "103c737e3ad5"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "43fdd29607f2"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Chaque critère configuré s'affiche avec "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Passer / ECHEC / N/A", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Pass / Fail / N/A", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "). Répondez à chacun d'eux."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "4f7b2753c315"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "106e68145164"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Acceptez l'échantillon.", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Avec le niveau "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Obligatoire", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", le bouton "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Valider l'échantillon", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Accept sample", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") reste "}, {"type": "text", "text": "désactivé tant que tous les éléments n'ont pas reçu de réponse", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " (la condition préalable) ; une fois toutes les réponses saisies, l'échantillon passe à "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Accepté", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " et le bouton Valider l'échantillon devient actif. Avec le niveau "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Facultatif", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", les réponses sont enregistrées mais l'acceptation n'est pas bloquée ; avec le niveau "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Désactivé", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", aucune liste de contrôle ne s'affiche."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "9bc67b4e9326"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "d225f4cd6080"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Si un critère n'est pas satisfait, utilisez "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Signaler une non-conformité", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Report NCE", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", pour enregistrer un événement non conforme) ou "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Rééchantillonner", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Resample", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") au lieu d'accepter l'échantillon."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "align-start", "width": 1020, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 2880, "id": "8f8d85c3-2c7c-4c13-98eb-9617130ef3b0", "collection": "contentId-1435566088", "type": "file", "localId": "47fca8d36e24", "height": 4042}}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "b905073dfc93"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "La liste de contrôle Validation de l'admission de la Revue Assurance Qualité : l'élément configuré affiché avec Passer / ECHEC / N/A, et Valider l'échantillon désactivé tant qu'aucune réponse n'est saisie.", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "9a4915344a18"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Description des champs"}]}, {"type": "table", "attrs": {"layout": "default", "width": 760.0, "localId": "01543e3b1fb5"}, "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "724d0faeb609"}, "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "aa21c312dbae"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "a24bd5b43c2f"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Champ"}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "acaa482373dc"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "a2bb45ef055b"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Remarques"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "3bed4cc3a222"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "dbf6db4ed679"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "4e18a27e5d81"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Checklist enforcement (niveau d'application, par domaine)"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "a2983e4fe940"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "b9f717f4cbd1"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Obligatoire", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " : réponse requise à chaque élément pour accepter l'échantillon (condition préalable) ; "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Facultatif", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " : enregistre les réponses sans bloquer ; "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Désactivé", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " : masque la liste de contrôle."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "0c7aac8cd164"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "bb0108f1bc94"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "e9f2ef72848d"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Élément : Etiquette"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "47ca62a77acc"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "53a983591c7d"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Le texte du critère d'acceptation affiché lors de la Revue Assurance Qualité."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "6b9a10d71356"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "3f608e797ad2"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "cec3536e53c3"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Élément : Actif"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "487f6e6f5952"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "0ef3697f32df"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Indique si l'élément est en vigueur ; les éléments communs au laboratoire s'affichent comme « Active (inherited) » dans un domaine."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "98d3aa6e1ade"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "5d4e6f7c025f"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "34faac1e2e0c"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Élément : Demande d'examen (ordre)"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "5a284cf16aa4"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "fe77592939ee"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ordre d'affichage ; modifiez-le avec les flèches haut/bas."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "a439a4f854ee"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "323dd9c294da"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "77878a14adf3"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Passer / ECHEC / N/A"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "f935dcf08442"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "5ff965c74c10"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "La réponse enregistrée pour chaque critère lors de la Revue Assurance Qualité."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "attrs": {"localId": "9e922985a0e1"}, "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "b647c4844d97"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "7d0ec10e49dc"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Valider l'échantillon / Signaler une non-conformité / Rééchantillonner"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1, "localId": "6b21832ac72d"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "54c8e7c473b3"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Accepter l'échantillon (activé une fois les réponses saisies avec le niveau Obligatoire), enregistrer une non-conformité ou demander un nouveau prélèvement."}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "4aedc6497c0f"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Remarques et conseils"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "attrs": {"localId": "db5664dd8d39"}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "3c2da39b91ae"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "de751ef123a7"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "D'abord la liste commune, puis la spécialisation :", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " définissez les critères communs dans "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Tous les domaines", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ; n'ajoutez des éléments propres à un domaine que là où il diffère. Les domaines héritent automatiquement de la liste commune au laboratoire."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "a2863bed6ab2"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "b6edb33c207e"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Le niveau d'application se définit "}, {"type": "text", "text": "par domaine", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " : modifier Clinique ne modifie ni Environnemental ni Vecteur."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "9a5a604c8019"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "14672c9e5a74"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Passer un domaine à "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Désactivé", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " masque la liste de contrôle pour les demandes de ce domaine sans supprimer les éléments configurés."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "c37822119c32"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "07fb5d0feb22"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Il ne s'agit "}, {"type": "text", "text": "pas", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " de l'action "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Rejeter l'échantillon", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " propre à chaque échantillon (une commande distincte avec ses propres motifs de rejet)."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "0441f518d002"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "5849ba2a0d43"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Le champ « Transit » de la Revue Assurance Qualité est affiché à titre indicatif uniquement ; il n'évalue pas automatiquement la liste de contrôle."}]}]}]}], "version": 1}}